1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,583
Draw your own analysis straight on the chart.

2
00:00:02,633 --> 00:00:07,285
Drawings are saved to your account, on that asset, and show on every candle size.

3
00:00:29,849 --> 00:00:33,605
Press the pencil at the top right of the chart to open the drawing tools.

4
00:00:34,082 --> 00:00:36,921
A trend line: drag from one point to another.

5
00:00:36,971 --> 00:00:39,212
Here, under two rising lows.

6
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:42,979
A horizontal line marks a price level right across the chart,

7
00:00:42,999 --> 00:00:44,823
with its price on the right.

8
00:00:45,293 --> 00:00:49,305
Fibonacci retracement: drag from a swing low to a swing high.

9
00:00:49,355 --> 00:00:54,284
The golden pocket, between sixty-one point eight and sixty-five percent, is shaded.

10
00:00:54,764 --> 00:00:55,156
Measure:

11
00:00:55,176 --> 00:00:59,395
drag between two points to see the percent change and the number of candles.

12
00:01:01,137 --> 00:01:05,917
The long or short position: drag from your entry to your stop, then tap your target.

13
00:01:05,967 --> 00:01:08,272
It shows the reward against the risk.

14
00:01:08,759 --> 00:01:11,406
Add a text note anywhere, then press Enter.

15
00:01:12,846 --> 00:01:15,557
Pick a colour and a line width before you draw.

16
00:01:15,607 --> 00:01:17,333
Undo takes back the last change,

17
00:01:17,353 --> 00:01:20,600
and the eye hides your drawings without deleting them.

18
00:01:21,293 --> 00:01:25,134
The share button sends the chart, with your drawings, to your communities.

19
00:01:25,184 --> 00:01:28,492
They open it on the same asset, with your drawings on it.

20
00:01:28,962 --> 00:01:31,779
And the bin removes every drawing on this asset.

21
00:01:31,829 --> 00:01:34,583
Press it twice, so you can't do it by accident.
